  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Peace and Security for Sustainable Development  (Dumisha Amani II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to consolidate peace and prevent violence; address the root causes conflict such as unemployment and other forms vulnerability; fast-track implementation of conflict prevention activities; and enhance complementarity and coordination between and among diverse actors engaged in peace consolidation processes. Hence, the project will deliver 3 integrated outputs:1. Infrastructures for peace (I4P) designed and operationalised at national and local level.2. Enhanced community mechanisms for conflict prevention for targeted groups incl. women and youth groups3. Strengthened Peace and Development Nexus and social cohesion through peace dividends and economic empowerment initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
